{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following matrices is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e0cea6d19176358095d28256b64473dfecdcad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\begin{bmatrix} 2 &amp; 3 \\\\ 5 &amp; 7 \\end{bmatrix} - 5 \\begin{bmatrix} 7 &amp; 5 \\\\ 3 &amp; 2 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"155\" height=\"45\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74b55f07d4fab1e4618a65f8e5f20d0c3e17c5af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\begin{bmatrix} -27 &amp; -2 \\\\ 5 &amp; 5 \\end{bmatrix} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\begin{bmatrix} -5 &amp; -2 \\\\ 2 &amp; 5 \\end{bmatrix} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\begin{bmatrix} 15 &amp; -12 \\\\ -8 &amp; -5 \\end{bmatrix} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\begin{bmatrix} -27 &amp; -13 \\\\ 5 &amp; 18 \\end{bmatrix} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\begin{bmatrix} -27 &amp; -13 \\\\ 2 &amp; 5 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"797\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/5119c60d88853f65f001f9bebe50e7e7d933c864.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\begin{bmatrix} 2 &amp; 3 \\\\ 5 &amp; 7 \\end{bmatrix} - 5 \\begin{bmatrix} 7 &amp; 5 \\\\ 3 &amp; 2 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 \\times 4 &amp; 3 \\times 4 \\\\ 5 \\times 4 &amp; 7 \\times 4 \\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix} 5 \\times 7 &amp; 5 \\times 5 \\\\ 5 \\times 3 &amp; 5 \\times 2 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"434\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d156032324742ffd09f5301b2d6cbfe39cc55244.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\begin{bmatrix} 8 &amp; 12 \\\\ 20 &amp; 28 \\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix} 35 &amp; 25 \\\\ 15 &amp; 10 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"187\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/9552b232fa8663a2a90e92246037da4cade38c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\begin{bmatrix} 8 - 35 &amp; 12 - 25 \\\\ 20 - 15 &amp; 28 - 10 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"174\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2885c27a15b8192c1a8d999113b185d982ffae53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\begin{bmatrix} -27 &amp; -13 \\\\ 5 &amp; 18 \\end{bmatrix}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"171\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a>